{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02826","headline":"晚渡渭桥寄示京邑游好 · 卢照邻","name":"晚渡渭桥寄示京邑游好","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我行背城阙，驱马独悠悠。\n寥落百年事，裴回万里忧。\n途遥日向夕，时晚鬓将秋。\n滔滔俯东逝，耿耿泣西浮。\n长虹掩钓浦，落雁下星洲。\n草变黄山曲，花飞清渭流。\n迸水惊愁鹭，腾沙起狎鸥。\n一赴清泥道，空思玄灞游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}